As I said, the game is a learning one. Specifically, this game is designed
to teach someone a new language from nothing, learning words, grammar, etc.
by playing the game.

Basically, your answers were overly complicated. There's no rule that says
you can't use stuff that hasn't been introduced, but I'm betting that's
because it's not expected for the players to know anything that hasn't.

In any case, the reason why {ko'a rokci} is the answer to {ko'a mo} is
because all you're expected to know is {.i ko'a goi ta rokci .i ko'e goi ta
grana}

